## 7. Command Code (B4.13)
# Harness's Command Code hook file is <env.COMMANDCODE_HOME>\settings.json (commandcode/contract.ts), and at a launch
# <COMMANDCODE_HOME || HOME\.commandcode> (kit/nativeLocations.ts). Command Code 1.84.0 builds every path as
# ${HOME ?? USERPROFILE}/.commandcode in platform-neutral code (B4.13), so it never reads COMMANDCODE_HOME on any
# platform: a person who sets COMMANDCODE_HOME gets hooks where Command Code does not look, on mac and Linux too. On
# Windows a second mismatch: Harness's default is os.homedir() (USERPROFILE) while Command Code prefers HOME when set.
# Finding only, no fix. Command Code is not installed and not signed in on the VM: not run.

